	(text_box "Power tree: fused/reverse-protected 12-24 V input; one LMR36510 5 V/1 A synchronous buck; WeAct onboard 3.3 V regulation supplies the logic rail; ESP-01 and ESP-01S share a separate 3.3 V LDO. Isolated field commons remain separate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0.0000)
